  "uncertain": [
    "Board grouping: the main view shows the T3-S3-MVSRBoard_V1.0 daughterboard stacked over a T3-S3 board; the 13+13 holes visible are on the stacked board and carry no silkscreen, so the callout-to-hole mapping relies on row alignment and on the callouts applying to the stacked board's holes."
  ],
  "notes": "Labels from the callout boxes (number box placed first in functions when it differs). Board holes have no silkscreen labels. Speaker (BCLK/LRCLK/DATA/SD_MODE), microphone (BCLK/WS/DATA/EN), OLED, TF card, LoRa module and vibration motor (46) tables list GPIO assignments without physical pin positions and are not merged into header pins. The bottom of the board (GWIIC/battery area) is covered by the speaker and not shown."
